Subject: [PATCH] FieldBase::GetNumValues: model rewrite accepted by the search
 (generation 40)

Provenance: greedy search, seed 2, generation 40, region 143 (FieldBase::GetNumValues).
Generated by the model (deepseek-v4.1-flash); not hand-written. Search-time ratio R (candidate/stock, <1 is faster): 0.8472 -> 0.8233 at acceptance (max of two measurements). This is a ranking value, NOT an independent per-patch
confirmation; only the fixed FINAL patch of the run was re-measured independently.
Cumulative patch it was derived from: runs/deepseek/greedy-s2-1072867/patches/gen_40.patch (diff against stock; do not apply together with the others).
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/fit_field_base.cpp | 8 ++++++--
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/fit_field_base.cpp b/src/fit_field_base.cpp
index 121f95f..0d2f7eb 100644
--- a/src/fit_field_base.cpp
+++ b/src/fit_field_base.cpp
@@ -105,8 +105,12 @@ FIT_UINT8 FieldBase::GetNumValues(void) const
     if (!IsValid())
         return 0;
 
-    if (GetType() != FIT_BASE_TYPE_STRING)
-        return (FIT_UINT8)(values.size() / baseTypeSizes[GetType() & FIT_BASE_TYPE_NUM_MASK]);
+    const FIT_UINT8 type = GetType();
+    if (type != FIT_BASE_TYPE_STRING)
+    {
+        static const FIT_UINT8 shifts[16] = {0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0, 2, 3, 0, 1, 2, 0, 3, 3};
+        return (FIT_UINT8)(values.size() >> shifts[type & FIT_BASE_TYPE_NUM_MASK]);
+    }
 
     return (FIT_UINT8)stringIndexes.size();
 }
